# Build context exclusions for docker build.
# The submodules are pulled as NuGet/Bolero deps by dotnet restore; the
# thirdparty/ dirs (Bolero, radzen-blazor, IoskeleyMono, ...) are NOT needed
# inside the image and would bloat the build context enormously.

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.git/
site/
docs/
projects/
BOLERO-SPIKE/
thirdparty/
*.md
.vscode/
.gitignore
Dockerfile
.dockerignore